            <ArticleTitle>An Unconventional Approach to Photomobile Composite Polymer Films.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/adma.201604800</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Photomobile polymer (Pmp) films are fabricated by using a cheap and fast process. The working mechanism of the Pmp-film motion under illumination is explained. Details concerning the film structure and formation are given. Two related applications regarding light-induced caterpillar-miming motion and photocontrolled electrical switches are proposed.</AbstractText>
